{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o019a","title":"刘备策诸葛亮为丞相","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o019a-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"刘备策诸葛亮为丞相","evidence":["zhuge-e-o019a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"任用","evidence":["zhuge-e-o019a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"受任","evidence":["zhuge-e-o019a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"刘备即帝位","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o018","basis":"刘备即帝位"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o019a-q","zhuge-q-o018","zhuge-q-b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o019a-q","source_order":[35,103,"O019a"],"order":6774}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o019a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-21b154ee90cd41653608","layer":"original","quote":"先主于是即帝位。策亮为丞相曰：“朕遭家不造〖15〗，奉承大统；兢兢业业，不敢康宁〖16〗；思靖百姓〖17〗，惧未能绥。於戏！丞相亮其悉朕意，无怠辅朕之阙〖18〗；助宣重光，以照明天下。君其勖哉〖19〗！”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗二十六年：建安二十六年（公元 221 ）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fe27b75c71b1c8c0ed04","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o018","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9c6ac9490dfbf75fe10c","layer":"original","quote":"二十六年〖2〗，群下劝先主称尊号〖3〗，先主未许。亮说曰：“昔吴汉、耿弇等初劝世祖即帝位〖4〗，世祖辞让，前后数四，耿纯进言曰〖5〗：‘天下英雄喁喁〖6〗，冀有所望〖7〗。如不从议者，士大夫各归求主〖8〗，无为从公也〖9〗！’世祖感纯言深至〖10〗，遂然诺之〖11〗。今曹氏篡汉，天下无主；大王刘氏苗族〖12〗，绍世而起〖13〗：今即帝位，乃其宜也！士大夫随大王久勤苦者，亦欲望尺寸之功如纯言耳〖14〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
